{"5364920":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Universal Chess","steam_appid":5364920,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Universal Chess is a chess variant on an 8×8 board. King and Queen are both Sovereigns and move in the same way. The strongest piece is the Armored. With them are the Elephant, Horse, Camel, Infantryman and Towers.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play alone against the computer, with two people at the same computer, or have two computers play each other. Before the game you choose the setup of the Sovereigns and heavy pieces, from 192 positions, the regime and the movement of the heavy pieces. The regime can be a diarchy, a monarchy of the King or a monarchy of the Queen. Movement can be standard or enhanced.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The martial rule, atomic permutation, sovereign castling and the infantry retreat can also be used.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The interface is available in Italian and English.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Universal Chess is a chess variant on an 8×8 board. King and Queen are both Sovereigns and move in the same way. The strongest piece is the Armored. With them are the Elephant, Horse, Camel, Infantryman and Towers.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play alone against the computer, with two people at the same computer, or have two computers play each other. Before the game you choose the setup of the Sovereigns and heavy pieces, from 192 positions, the regime and the movement of the heavy pieces. The regime can be a diarchy, a monarchy of the King or a monarchy of the Queen. Movement can be standard or enhanced.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The martial rule, atomic permutation, sovereign castling and the infantry retreat can also be used.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The interface is available in Italian and English.<\/p>","short_description":"Universal Chess is a chess variant on an 8×8 board. King and Queen are both Sovereigns. Play alone against the computer, with two people at one computer, or with two computers. Choose from 192 setups, the regime, and standard or enhanced movement.","supported_languages":"English, Italian","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5364920\/66d38b26b4d5644e2614f8c829d4690a67cd3755\/header.jpg?t=1793694948","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5364920\/bc5378f6899660a0bd54426be82e10e592e9c687\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793694948","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5364920\/bc5378f6899660a0bd54426be82e10e592e9c687\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793694948","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual-core 64 bit processor<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Integrated graphics<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Mouse required<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"legal_notice":"Copyright © 2026 Tediolux","developers":["Tediolux"],"publishers":["Tediolux"],"package_groups":[],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":49,"desc